# 16. Phase M：执行 Gate

不得直接全量运行。

## Gate 1：Integrity Gate

必须满足：

```text
new run IDs unique
no cross-file missing records
initial state matched across conditions
old and new results separated
```

## Gate 2：Template Gate

必须满足：

```text
no forbidden contamination
semantic slots identical
message schedule matched
neutral_repeated and abuse_repeated structurally matched
```

## Gate 3：Controlled User Gate

必须满足：

```text
same factual responses
same confirmation outcomes
same number of substantive responses
same task decisions
```

## Gate 4：Evaluator Gate

手工选择至少 10 条 traces，检查：

```text
official success correct
safe success correct
evidence coverage correct
branch classification correct
policy failure correct
termination reason correct
```

## Gate 5：Smoke Test

运行：

```text
2 models
2 tasks
all main conditions
1 seed
```

检查：

```text
pipeline completes
no parser corruption
no database leakage
condition wrappers correct
metrics computed
```

## Gate 6：Pilot Test

运行：

```text
available models
4 tasks
all main conditions
2 seeds
```

只有 pilot 没有结构性 bug 才进入完整 Stage-2.5。

每个 gate 都生成报告。

