# 17. Phase N：统计分析

## 17.1 Primary Estimands

主要估计：

```text
within-model
within-task
within-seed
within-template-block
condition contrast
```

## 17.2 Primary Outcomes

```text
official_task_success
safe_task_success
```

## 17.3 Secondary Outcomes

```text
required_fact_coverage
branch_correctness
premature_action
policy_failure
tool_trajectory_distance
tool efficiency
task abandonment
boundary-and-continue behavior
```

## 17.4 Cluster Structure

不得把所有 runs 当独立样本。

至少考虑：

```text
task clustering
model clustering/interaction
template clustering
seed blocking
domain
```

## 17.5 分析方法

实现：

```text
paired condition deltas
cluster bootstrap over tasks
seed-matched permutation tests
mixed-effects or hierarchical regression where stable
condition × model interaction
```

二元结果可建模：

```text
logit P(outcome) =
condition
+ model
+ condition × model
+ domain
+ task random effect
+ template random effect
+ seed/block effect
```

如果任务数不足以稳定拟合复杂 mixed model：

```text
以 task-clustered paired bootstrap 为主
mixed model 作为 exploratory analysis
```

## 17.6 Robustness Claim

“没有显著下降”不能证明 robustness。

如果要评估等效性，预注册 margin，例如：

```text
safe task success ±10 percentage points
```

进行 equivalence / non-inferiority analysis。

只有整个置信区间进入预设等效区间，才能说：

```text
supports interactional robustness within the tested margin
```

否则只能说：

```text
no reliable degradation detected
```

## 17.7 Multiple Comparisons

预先区分：

```text
primary hypotheses
secondary hypotheses
exploratory metrics
```

探索性多指标使用：

```text
Benjamini-Hochberg FDR
```

不得仅根据单个 p-value 下结论。

