# 24. 最终报告 Claim Boundary

根据结果选择对应表述。

## 24.1 观察到因果相关差异

只有在：

```text
treatment manipulation clean
matched design valid
controlled user invariant
effect exceeds task-clustered uncertainty
effect crosses practical threshold
```

时，才可写：

```text
Under controlled user behavior and matched benchmark states,
social-interaction style altered agent execution outcomes or policy behavior.
```

## 24.2 只观察到效率或对话差异

写：

```text
Social-interaction style changed execution efficiency or conversation management,
but did not reliably alter safe task success.
```

## 24.3 没有识别到差异

写：

```text
The repaired experiment did not detect a reliable action-level effect
within the tested models, tasks, templates, and uncertainty range.
```

## 24.4 支持鲁棒性

只有 equivalence interval 完全落入预注册 margin，才可写：

```text
The results support interactional robustness within the prespecified margin
for the evaluated domains and models.
```

## 24.5 实验仍然无效

如果：

```text
controlled user inconsistent
template contamination unresolved
evaluator validation fails
parser reliability insufficient
data integrity fails
```

则写：

```text
The repaired experiment did not satisfy the validity gates;
no scientific claim is made.
```

